@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333
@token = substitua-pelo-access-token
@transactionId = substitua-pelo-id

### Saúde
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Cadastro
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Lima",
  "email": "maria@example.com",
  "password": "senha-segura"
}

### Login da conta de demonstração
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@mbacademy.dev",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Usuário atual
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar transação
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "description": "Curso de TypeScript",
  "amountInCents": 12990,
  "category": "education",
  "occurredAt": "2026-09-09"
}

### Listar com filtros e paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=expense&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar uma transação
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar parcialmente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountInCents": 14990
}

### Resumo do período
GET {{baseUrl}}/summary?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remover
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
